      "html": "<p>A pub cellar is one of the most hazardous rooms in the building. It holds gas cylinders, caustic cleaning chemicals, heavy kegs and wet floors. The Health and Safety at Work etc. Act 1974 puts the duty on the employer to keep it safe. Your job is to check it and write down what you find.</p>"
